    <div class="ghat-rule"></div>
    <div class="ghat-desc">The tilting Shiva temple, half-submerged in the Ganga, stands as proof that even stone must bow to the river. Built by the Scindia dynasty and swallowed by the flood — still visited, still consecrated, still alive.</div>
